---
import CopyCommand from './CopyCommand.astro'
const base = 'install-tab'
---
<div class="install-tabs">
  <input type="radio" name={base} id={`${base}-claude`} checked />
  <input type="radio" name={base} id={`${base}-codex`} />
  <input type="radio" name={base} id={`${base}-cursor`} />
  <input type="radio" name={base} id={`${base}-opencode`} />
  <input type="radio" name={base} id={`${base}-agy`} />
  <input type="radio" name={base} id={`${base}-manual`} />

  <!-- Must NOT be a <div>: the panel selectors below use div:nth-of-type counting -->
  <nav class="tab-labels">
    <label for={`${base}-claude`}>Claude</label>
    <label for={`${base}-codex`}>Codex</label>
    <label for={`${base}-cursor`}>Cursor</label>
    <label for={`${base}-opencode`}>opencode</label>
    <label for={`${base}-agy`}>Antigravity</label>
    <label for={`${base}-manual`}>手动</label>
  </nav>

  <div class="tab-panel" data-tab="claude">
    <p>使用根目录生成好的 <code>.claude-plugin/</code> 作为本地插件包，安装后重新加载插件。</p>
  </div>
  <div class="tab-panel" data-tab="codex">
    <p>使用本地插件目录安装：</p>
    <CopyCommand command="codex plugin add ./plugins/wld-design" />
  </div>
  <div class="tab-panel" data-tab="cursor">
    <p>把仓库里的 <code>plugins/wld-design/</code> 复制到你的项目：</p>
    <pre><code>你的项目/.cursor/plugins/wld-design/</code></pre>
  </div>
  <div class="tab-panel" data-tab="opencode">
    <p>把仓库里的 <code>.opencode/</code> 复制到你的项目根目录。已有 <code>.opencode/</code> 时合并内容，不要整文件夹覆盖。</p>
  </div>
  <div class="tab-panel" data-tab="agy">
    <p>把 <code>plugins/wld-design/</code> 的内容复制到本地，然后：</p>
    <CopyCommand command="agy plugin install <插件所在目录>" />
    <p><code>plugin.json</code> 应在该目录的一级目录下。</p>
  </div>
  <div class="tab-panel" data-tab="manual">
    <p>复制 <code>plugins/wld-design/skills/</code> 到你项目中的 <code>.agents/</code>、<code>.claude/</code> 等目录，并确保 <code>plugins/wld-design/assets/</code> 一起可用。</p>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .install-tabs input {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip-path: inset(50%);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .tab-labels { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .tab-labels label {
    padding: 8px 18px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--surface);
    font-size: 14px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .tab-panel { display: none; }
  .tab-panel p { margin: 8px 0; font-size: 14px; }
  .download-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 8px;
    background: var(--gold);
    color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 10px 22px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .download-btn:hover { background: var(--gold-deep); }
  .tab-panel pre {
    background: var(--navy);
    color: #fff;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 16px;
    font-size: 13px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    margin: 8px 0;
  }
  .install-tabs input:nth-of-type(1):checked ~ .tab-labels label:nth-of-type(1),
  .install-tabs input:nth-of-type(2):checked ~ .tab-labels label:nth-of-type(2),
  .install-tabs input:nth-of-type(3):checked ~ .tab-labels label:nth-of-type(3),
  .install-tabs input:nth-of-type(4):checked ~ .tab-labels label:nth-of-type(4),
  .install-tabs input:nth-of-type(5):checked ~ .tab-labels label:nth-of-type(5),
  .install-tabs input:nth-of-type(6):checked ~ .tab-labels label:nth-of-type(6) {
    background: var(--gold);
    border-color: var(--gold);
    color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); /* dark text on gold — body text is light on this theme */
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .install-tabs input:nth-of-type(1):checked ~ .tab-panel:nth-of-type(1),
  .install-tabs input:nth-of-type(2):checked ~ .tab-panel:nth-of-type(2),
  .install-tabs input:nth-of-type(3):checked ~ .tab-panel:nth-of-type(3),
  .install-tabs input:nth-of-type(4):checked ~ .tab-panel:nth-of-type(4),
  .install-tabs input:nth-of-type(5):checked ~ .tab-panel:nth-of-type(5),
  .install-tabs input:nth-of-type(6):checked ~ .tab-panel:nth-of-type(6) {
    display: block;
  }
  .install-tabs input:nth-of-type(1):focus-visible ~ .tab-labels label:nth-of-type(1),
  .install-tabs input:nth-of-type(2):focus-visible ~ .tab-labels label:nth-of-type(2),
  .install-tabs input:nth-of-type(3):focus-visible ~ .tab-labels label:nth-of-type(3),
  .install-tabs input:nth-of-type(4):focus-visible ~ .tab-labels label:nth-of-type(4),
  .install-tabs input:nth-of-type(5):focus-visible ~ .tab-labels label:nth-of-type(5),
  .install-tabs input:nth-of-type(6):focus-visible ~ .tab-labels label:nth-of-type(6) {
    outline: 2px solid var(--gold);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }
</style>
